        ContentList
          Text("Say nothing")
        ContentList
          Text("\n")
        VariableReference(drugged)
      Text("I fold my arms, intended firmly to say nothing. But somehow, watching Harris' face, I cannot bring myself to do it. I want to confess. I want to tell him everything I can, to explain myself to him, to earn his forgiveness. The sensation is so strong my will is powerless in the face of it.")
